    "Description": "The Automatic Bug Reporting Tool (ABRT) recognizes defects in applications and creates bug reports that help maintainers fix the defects. ABRT uses a plug-in system to extend its functionality. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* abrt: Command-injection in ABRT leading to local privilege escalation (CVE-2025-12744)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
